# AWW Counselling Platform

A MERN-based platform designed to support Anganwadi Workers (AWWs) in counselling pregnant women.

## Core Flow

AWW → Beneficiary → Counselling Form → Decision Tree → AI Guidance → Counselling → Attendance → Report → Admin Monitoring

## Main Modules

- AWW Management
- Beneficiary Management
- Counselling
- Decision Tree & Rules
- AI Assistance
- Reports
- Learning Path
- Performance & Milestones
- Admin Management

## Tech Stack

- Frontend: React
- Backend: Node.js + Express
- Database: MongoDB
- AI: AI/Voice Assistant